      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional 6-Bedroom Detached Family Residence\r\n\r\nDiscover this impressive detached family home, offering six spacious bedrooms, a dedicated study, and generous living accommodation designed for modern family life. Beautifully presented with a low-maintenance red brick exterior, the property features two bright reception rooms, a bright sunroom overlooking the rear garden, kitchen, utility room and guest wc. The first floor has 4 bedrooms (master bedroom ensuite) and study and a family bathroom.  The second floor has two large bedrooms complete with a walk-in wardrobe. Additional features include oil-fired central heating, a bottled gas hob, a detached garage with an electric door, and a cobblelocked driveway.\r\n\r\nSituated within a highly sought-after residential estate, this exceptional home enjoys a superb location just 2 km west of Blackrock Village and 4 km south of Dundalk Town Centre. Residents benefit from easy access to a wide range of local amenities, including Blackrock's shops, cafés and restaurants, Felda Health Fitness & Spa, and Dundalk Golf Club. The M1 Motorway is only minutes away, providing a convenient commute to Dublin Airport in approximately 40 minutes, while regular train and bus services from Dundalk offer excellent transport links to Dublin and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Front : Cobblelocked driveway, landscaped, planted areas\r\n\r\nSide: Garage: Electric door, access to the side, cobblelocked driveway to side\r\n\r\nRear: Large rear garden with lawn, part cobblelocked, OFCH, bottled gas for gas hob\r\n\r\nEntrance Porch with tiled floor, wired for alarm\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room with wall and floor mounted units, tiled surround, oven, electric hob, gas hob, extractor fan, integrated fridge freezer, granite worktops\r\n\r\nUtility Room with two washing machines and dryer, fridge freezer, wired for alarm, tiled foor, access to rear garden (inventory for the house upon request)\r\n\r\nHallway L Shaped with wooden floor, understairs storage off, \r\n\r\nLiving Room with wooden floor, feature open fireplace with marble surround, bay window\r\n\r\nLarge Open plan Living/Dining Room with feature fireplace with newly fitted Stanley burner, marble surround, carpet, recessed lighting, bay window, doors to \r\n\r\nSun Room, access to the rear\r\n\r\nBathroom fully tiled, wc, whb with vanity under, shower, mirror, and under counter lighting\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nFirst Floor hallway with carpet, walk in hot press\r\n\r\nBedroom One Carpet, Built in wardrobes and desk\r\n\r\nBedroom Two with carpet, extensive built in wardrobes, ensuite, wc, whb with vanity under, carpet, shower, tiled, tiled walls, window\r\n\r\nStudy Room/Bedroom\r\n\r\nBathroom with wc, whb, shower, carpet, tiled walls, window, corner bath, whb, vanity under and lights\r\n\r\nBedroom Three Carpet, fitted wardrobes, built in desk \r\n\r\nBedroom Four Built in wardrobes, carpet, built in desk\r\n\r\nUpstairs 2nd Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom Five Carpet, walk in wardrobes, storage into the eaves\r\n\r\nBedroom Six with velux window, carpet, walk in wardrobes"
      },
